            "heading": "Built to Last. Designed for Annual Replacement",
            "description": "<p>Made with high-quality CTC-60 coconut shell activated carbon, Phoenix Gravity Carbon Filter Elements are designed to last up to 12 months, depending on your source water quality and usage. Enjoy reliable filtration and better-tasting water, with a simple once-a-year replacement routine.</p>",
